            "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "complaints"
            ]
        },
        "description": "Submit a facility complaint for a completed reservation. The reservation must be 'completed' and owned by the authenticated user. Attach an optional photo as multipart/form-data (max 10MB, auto-compressed if >2MB)."
